    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172cdba51e924e53038089ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她看上去……好像有些害羞了？\r\n——应该是我的错觉吧？\r\n等今后我更加了解她之后，说不定便能探明这感情的真相了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a941374089ef212ef1846388bd591cf49c8847e23b241faef9f0a037a1e5de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
