    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b5d48c1956f76f5a6c18ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……还是很难理解。\r\n每次当我想要对她的提问作出回答时，\r\n便要思考好一阵她到底想表达什么意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af97749439c62bfd24913d9ec3fbdd18007d8b0ca232f33e49b030f341ae03aa",
