      "uid": "zhcn:188532486d4a35dd7ee5316e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您要与新宇宙……“通讯”吗？\r\n这是为了……“INTI”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84bf85c80486fd3737034601091c4afd326bab95297d8e6ee048f4b6da4e33a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
