      "uid": "zhcn:f83294897f03886a0462671b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要加深对对方的理解——在我如此表达心意之后，\r\n过了一段时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c5867c8d279eea01febab79c296b7e38738b11d3b4949f48dd2028fe1c7fcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
