      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……必须要更加仔细地“观测”才行。\r\n一旦错过，就将化为“流星”……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f241ec0bb6922c811a23875872921d08d700b3f784ec120927d55ffba52559",
