    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f964e69998d95f2e443873",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而每当我这样想的时候，\r\n眼下她这般如小狗一般天真而好奇的模样便会浮上心头……\r\n……呃，这样想的话，对她太失礼了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1786d7000d79be02a47db636134b6835faab79f3f8e76f9f9242a2e1070198",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ce772a7ee627ffdecb2740",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你准备去哪里玩吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6da5ca527bc3704c3ca337e4b0ebea73b0d989caeb44c4eeb24d27cc144a706",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
