      "uid": "zhcn:558962f9599c222d5f1a2550",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大概是……『我得自己找出答案』……的意思吧。\r\n虽说她的模样看上去的确有些不对劲……\r\n但似乎也并非是什么沉重的烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "185c459656d6a35e5473b768703f9885c048a08603b0dcb3fb22cc9a26589f17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
