      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "需要摄入『水分』。\r\n虽看不见“北极星”……但『目的地』仍在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9239fb0e48410d825e78db3f0997fafcabda50af654012d3c0b7398ede3af0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
