    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41a4b409ea7289e6215d59c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚刚那大概是『口渴了』的意思吧。\r\n这番话倒很容易理解——想到这儿，\r\n我不禁又笑了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71911c2181ba17cd45e4a2a8c95dfec5e8b8508f9a0d9fad20754a70a85a12b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
