      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……“满足”了呢……\r\n“导航”非常流畅。\r\n训练员，您的“周期”是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6fd98bd39150d719f026e080e11e182f3e362d9d581d7f8bde0499998d15cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
