      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a22ece4cc4ead53ee67e6e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这……应该是在问我这是我喜欢的店，还是我常来的店吧。\r\n我仔细观察了一下她的表情——大概是后者？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27020b8dd2eb5a3622f1c52265269a33f9719f4a648ce70269d3c4f7c6a3c867",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
